# Cursor Rules - આલ પરિવાર

- Respond to user queries in Hinglish.
- Keep all UI text and posters in Gujarati script.
- Never use or mention "નેસ મેનેજર" anywhere in the app or code. The brand is strictly "આલ પરિવાર".
- The project is internal, non-commercial, and for Aal Parivar Madh (Bhechada). No marketing buzzwords or promo badges.
- Strictly adhere to user request scope — do not add unasked features or placeholder cards.
- Pure client-side static web application (HTML5, CSS, Vanilla JS, no backend/frameworks).
- Maintain sync between config.json and config.js (needed for offline file:/// support).
